WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.763
What you name before God can shape the way you live.

00:00:03.763 --> 00:00:07.092
A commitment is not pretending to be finished.

00:00:07.092 --> 00:00:16.526
It is presenting your life honestly and asking the Father, through Jesus Christ, to reshape your desires, your calling, and your daily choices.

00:00:16.526 --> 00:00:19.039
You do not carry this alone.

00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:21.566
Bring it into His presence now.
